# Each LAYER declares its own kinds; the registry runs them once, lazily, on the first question
# anybody asks it. @see com.crystalgui.ui.dom.NodeKinds for why this is not a static block per widget.
#
# One line per layer, added when that layer's first widget is ported:
#   6.1  com.crystalgui.widget.Widgets
#   6.3  com.crystalgui.workbench.chrome.ChromeKinds  (folded under the workbench at 6.7)
#   6.1  com.crystalgui.desktop.DesktopKinds  (WindowIcon came early: Taskbar needs it)
#   6.7  com.crystalgui.workbench.WorkbenchKinds
com.crystalgui.widget.Widgets
com.crystalgui.workbench.chrome.ChromeKinds
com.crystalgui.desktop.DesktopKinds
com.crystalgui.workbench.WorkbenchKinds
